    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the professional advice thing, but it doesn't change the reality of it. i spent decades where every decision mattered, every second meant something. now i'm just an observer in my own life. it feels like i've already finished my part, you know? like the book is already written and i'm just staring at the blank pages at the end. it's just... hollow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
